t=\"X\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/X\" title=\"X\">X</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.2</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>惊魂秀</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：301003</div></div></div></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"301003\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301004.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/41/Belonging-301004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">破碎的面具<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Broken Mask</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.01<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>破损的白色面具，可能来自街角商店的万圣节装扮特卖活动。受访者笑着提出了这样的问题：是面具需要佩戴它的面孔，还是面孔需要面具赋予的意义？</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301005.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/76/Belonging-301005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">铁钩<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Iron Hook</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.03<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>穿进老旧皮衣的沉重铁钩，也许可以算作纽扣的另类替代者。“你看，做我们这行的多少有些怪癖。”受访者这样解释道，“它又实用又方便，不是吗？”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301006.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/76/Belonging-301006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">无人应答<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Unattended call</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一只断裂的电话听筒，被受访者随身携带。显然它不可能收到任何呼叫，因此受访者对它的喜爱也显而易见。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B81.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 沉默的呼吸1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B81.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B81.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B81.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B81.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B81.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B81.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B82.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 沉默的呼吸2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B82.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B82.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B82.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B82.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B82.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%98%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BC%E5%90%B82.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">沉默的呼吸 <small style=\"colo